ttps://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3784198","publishedAt":"2026-10-22T07:04:43.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"citationId":"ie8b9btolum681jyas4mnqv6y"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"汇丰银行推出港元稳定币 RedCoin 并接入 PayMe","summary":"香港汇丰银行（HSBC）已推出其港元稳定币 RedCoin，即日起可通过 PayMe 使用。未来几天内用户可在应用内开通稳定币钱包，用于个人对个人（P2P）以及个人对商户（P2M）的支付。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a166d2-f57f-73dd-8035-5b2b06729e28","publishedAt":"2026-10-23T03:34:23.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"i9x5695yf8w3flgqo51st7n2a"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"高盛白银追踪报告：美元回落银价仍跌，AI与光伏崩跌切断工业需求逻辑","summary":"高盛大宗商品策略师Robert Quinn在最新白银追踪报告中将局面定性为Still Stuck，指出过去三周管理型基金累计净卖出白银期货22亿美元，净多头降至约17亿美元、为高盛两年期数据最低。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3784191","publishedAt":"2026-10-22T07:40:22.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"sh6qx7zhczhj45usmow5yxrve"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"高盛报告量化AI对就业冲击：受冲击职业五年就业平均萎缩25%","summary":"高盛10月22日发布报告称，若AI最终带来15%生产率提升，过渡期内最多约9%的员工可能被替代，招聘放缓还可能对整体就业形成约3%的额外拖累。高盛选取照片冲印员、校对员、档案文员等25个受技术冲击最深的职业，其就业人数在技术冲击后五年平均下降约25%，其中照片冲印员降幅接近60%。报告还指出，岗位减少更多来自分离率上升而非招聘放缓，且经济走弱时企业会加速用AI压缩人力成本，放大岗位流失。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3784278","publishedAt":"2026-10-23T04:04:13.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"fuinpxp732xgmblsbimdybg72"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"报道称美以已制定对伊朗新一轮打击计划，布伦特原油涨至110.67美元","summary":"据央视新闻援引美国官员及知情人士消息，美以军方已制定美国中期选举后对伊朗发动短暂但密集打击的具体计划，目标涵盖能源基础设施、核设施及导弹无人机库，两国空军加强联合演练并派机飞越伊拉克进行模拟打击训练。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3784187","publishedAt":"2026-10-22T06:40:30.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"o7vbvxc41gqtpfxgdnxq02dfl"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bea8e42ecaae675437f1d85767b96c288a979621c45bc55640df59c09fbb8bcb.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7d7829b963afe835d4c9469a5d6120eb74c71d1e68c29cdeefc94446a6c51266.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bea8e42ecaae675437f1d85767b96c288a979621c45bc55640df59c09fbb8bcb.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"对冲基金大举做空，Goldman Sachs警告股市轧空风险","summary":"对冲基金本月大举增加股票空头头寸，看空押注接近五年高位，市场若反弹将面临急剧轧空风险。Goldman Sachs主经纪业务数据显示，其全球股票账簿中卖空规模约为买入规模的五倍，空头杠杆处于过去五年99分位；基本面多空基金的净杠杆接近三年低点，尽管总杠杆有所上升。","sourceName":"Bloomberg Markets","sourceUrl":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-10-22/hedge-funds-pile-into-shorts-as-goldman-flags-stock-squeeze-risk","publishedAt":"2026-10-22T09:51:03.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"u7td91tfs65r122jvfu9lussm"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"美国上周初请失业救济人数降至19.4万，创三个月新低","summary":"美国劳工部公布，截至10月17日当周初请失业救济人数减少6000人至19.4万，低于彭博调查预期的20万，四周移动均值降至19.775万，为2022年以来最低。续请失业救济人数增加2.5万至173万，升至六周高位。文章指出初请人数处于近60年低位区间，但招聘放缓、消费者信心低迷等迹象显示劳动力市场呈低招聘、低解雇格局，单凭这一指标不足以判断就业市场整体健康程度。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3784239","publishedAt":"2026-10-22T15:13:55.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"citationId":"gzz90i1g6qsv0u1ev16uj12bb"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Circle股东起诉特朗普及其家族加密企业，指控其借阿联酋交易牟利","summary":"据 Politico 报道，Circle Internet Group 一名股东周四在美国联邦法院起诉美国总统特朗普及其家族共同创立的加密企业 World Liberty Financial，指控其通过两笔涉及阿联酋的交易利用总统职务谋取私利，违反美国宪法外国酬金条款。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a16400-5e8f-7693-b233-46bb0bf40d99","publishedAt":"2026-10-22T14:25:08.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"citationId":"vhric8kz58i7r9sucxwq1xez1"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"黄仁勋回应AI投资三大焦点：GPU折旧期、CoreWeave债务与DeepSeek推理毛利","summary":"黄仁勋在GTC柏林大会后接受雅虎财经采访，回应AI投资三大焦点：GPU折旧期从市场认定的4年重估为7至8年且高残值可作贷款抵押品，英伟达已为部分芯片转售残值提供担保以助CoreWeave等云厂商降低融资成本；英伟达推出DSX Pod模块化方案，拟把部署周期从四至六个月压缩至三至四个月甚至更短，缩短资本空窗期。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3784165","publishedAt":"2026-10-22T04:07:39.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"bdpcujx1waknyu6cpaznekkva"}],"cover":null,"metrics":{"totalEvents":12,"sourcesCount":7,"firstPartyEvents":11},"readingMinutes":4,"prev":"2026-10-23","next":"2026-10-25"}